Vendored test fixtures — provenance
====================================

The Delta Lake table fixtures under this directory are copied verbatim (including their
_delta_log directories, checkpoint files, and Parquet data files) from the upstream projects
below, both licensed Apache License 2.0 (full text in licenses/). They are used exclusively as
test data to verify delta2ducklake's Delta log parsing and conversion logic; no source code was
copied.

